    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the client's objective to improve staff efficiency and care quality, and considering the hospital's size (4,500 staff) and bed count (1,200), what are our company's past experiences with similar public sector projects, and how can our company's leverage those experiences to inform our company's tender response? our company's, has experience working on public sector projects. our company's have successfully delivered a project for a regional council where our company's implemented an AI assistant that supported social-services case workers, with 600 users over 9 months." ;
